<div class="js-cookie-consent cookie-consent">
	<span class="cookie-consent__message">We use cookies for various purposes including analytics. By using our site and services, you agree to our use of cookies as described in the <a href="https://hypeddit.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Policy</a>.</span>
	<button class="js-cookie-consent-agree cookie-consent__agree"></button>

	
